-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",429,{
[13697]="7002AE73\n1\tCollect a jar of honey (eat pie for a burst of energy)\tThe Beehives of Tuckborough are south of Bywater. You should run to the small beehive stand along the road to the south and return with a new jar of honey before the time runs out.\n2\tCarry the honey-jar to the Farmers Market\tSperling Took, the supplier of the Farmers Faire, can be found in Bywater. You should return to Bywater as quickly as you can, taking bites of the pie to help you along if you find yourself needing a burst of energy.\n",
[13698]="7002A172\n1\tFind a friendly face in the Bonevales\tThe Bonevales are in the north of Dunland, south of the Lichbluffs in Enedwaith. You should follow the road south from the Lichbluffs and seek any friendly inhabitants of the Bonevales.\n",
[13699]="7003ABDF\n1\tSpeak with Gandalf in Edoras\tGandalf can be found near the main gate of Edoras. You were informed that Gandalf wishes to speak with you. You should go to him at once.\n2\tFind Húlac in the Broadacres\tHúlac can be found in the town of Stoke in the Broadacres. You should ride to Stoke and search for Húlac.\n",
[13700]="70017BD2\n1\tSpeak with Líkmund\tTo reach the Chamber of the Cross-roads, head north from the Deep Descent to the Dolven-view camp. From the Dolven-view, follow your map and the main lit roadway towards the Chamber of the Cross-roads.\n",
[13701]="70017BD1\n1\tTalk to Thettmárr at the Deep Descent\tThe Deep Descent is along the south path from the Dolven-view, at the north edge of the Silvertine Lodes. You should take the path south to discover the dwarf-hub at the Deep Descent.\n",
[13702]="70017BD0\n1\tTalk to Slagvi at the Dolven-view\tThe Dolven-view camp lies east of Lamab-dûm, at a somewhat central cross-roads in the Great Delving. You should follow the lit road as best you can to the Dolven-view.\n",
[13703]="70072FB4\n1\tMeet Mizâdi at her forward camp in Idagâl\tMizâdi is preparing to launch a campaign in Idagâl and asked for your aid. You should speak to Mizâdi at her camp near the border of An Shêru.\n",
[13704]="7003AB49\n1\tSpeak with Gandalf in Edoras\tGandalf can be found near the main gate of Edoras. You should hasten to Edoras to begin helping the people of the Eastfold.\n",
[13705]="7003AB60\n1\tSpeak with Gandalf in Edoras\tGandalf can be found near the main gate of Edoras. You should hasten to Edoras to begin helping the people of the Eastfold.\n",
[13706]="70021665\n1\tTalk to Neddie Grubb in Bywater\tNeddie Grubb can be found near the great pond in Bywater, just east of Hobbiton. You should speak with Neddie Grubb, who will introduce you to the fishing events of the Lithe Festival (and train the fishing hobby, if you have not already!)\n",
[13707]="70057187\n1\tTalk to Hunulf at the front gate of the Beorninghús\tHunulf can be found at the front gate of the Beorninghús. You should talk to Hunulf.\n2\tMourn the passing of Hunulf\tHunulf can be found at the front gate of the Beorninghús. You should mourn Hunulf's passing.\n3\tDeliver Hunulf's last words to Grimbeorn\tGrimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús. You should talk to Grimbeorn.\n4\tTalk to Léothred at the Beorninghús before you depart\tLéothred can be found at the front gate of the Beorninghús. You should talk to Léothred.\n5\tLight a candle for Hunulf at the Carrock\tThe Carrock can be found in the Beorninglands. You should light a candle for Hunulf at the Carrock.\n6\tTravel to Limlók in the Floodfells\tLimlók can be found in the Floodfells. You should travel to Limlók.\n7\tTalk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók\tRunerik Knotbeard is the Thane of Limlók, in the Floodfells. You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.\n",
[13708]="700270F7\n1\tTalk to Maugan at the Pristine Glade\tThe Pristine Glade lies to the west of Lhan Rhos, beyond a cave. Elder Déin has asked you to quickly go and help protect the last remaining secret of the Dunbog: the Pristine Glade.\n",
[13709]="70066CC5\n1\tDefeat Corsairs in Khatsûr (total: 6)\tFimlothel has asked you to aid the new recruits by repelling the Corsair advance from Khatsûr. Khatsûr can be found at the western edge of Anfalas.\n2\tTalk to Marra in Lond Cirion\tYou have helped quell the numbers of Corsairs in Khatsûr. You should report to Marra. Marra can be found in Lond Cirion.\n",
[13710]="70020A5A\n1\tTalk to Sally Threshing in the Horse-fields of Bree\030Talk to Carl Proudfoot in the Delving Fields of the Shire\tCarl Proudfoot can be found in the Delving Fields of the Shire, near Michel Delving. Sally Threshing can be found in the Horse-fields of Bree, at the Festival Grounds. You should speak with Sally Threshing and Carl Proudfoot to get yourself acquainted with this season's Festival Run.\n",
[13711]="70026F05\n1\tTalk to Harri at the hunters' camp\tThe hunters' camp lies to the south-east of Lhan Rhos. Bain has asked you to talk to the hunters and aid them, with the hope that your success will convince the Elders of Lhan Rhos to speak with you.\n",
[13712]="70021664\n1\tTalk to Jorfi (take a horse from the Thorin's Hall Stable-master to visit the race)\tThe Keg-races can be found by visiting the Stable-master of Thorin's Hall to take a ride to the race area. You should head to the Thorin's Hall Stable-master, where you will be directed to the Keg-races.\n",
[13713]="70002E1D\n1\tTalk to Alphlanc\tAlphlanc makes her camp at the head of the Last Bridge between the Lone-lands and the Trollshaws, far to the west of Rivendell. Anhebir has sent you to lend what aid you may to the Elf Alphlanc in the western Trollshaws.\n",
[13714]="700578FB\n1\tThe Splintered Shield is located on the Second Tier of Minas Tirith. You should go to The Splintered Shield in Minas Tirith and sample wines.\t\n2\tPick up the proper wine cask\tYou have found the wine the wedding planner requested. You should pick up the wine cask and bring it to the wedding planner in Minas Tirith.\n3\tDeliver the cask to Merilien\tThe wedding planner Merilien is on the Seventh Circle of Minas Tirith. You should bring the cask to Merilien.\n",
[13715]="7000D5B8\n1\tTalk to Captain Trotter\tSpeak with Captain Trotter in Trestlebridge to requisition a fast horse to the Forsaken Inn in the western Lonelands.\n",
[13716]="7007175C\n1\tTravel to Sâr Marsag\tDáthlil has given you supplies of the serum that the Rangers concocted to resist the blight. Bring them to the scouts in Sâr Marsag to the south.\n2\tSpeak with Tábai\tYou arrived in Sâr Marsag and see a scout named Tábai. Bring the supplies of the serum to him and let him know to distribute them.\n",
[13717]="700330E3\n1\tTalk to Avar at the Orc-watch (a goat is available for travel, for the journey is difficult)\tAvar is in the Orc-watch in the Redhorn Lodes, a long ways from the Twenty-first Hall through the many winding passages of Zelem-melek. Mögr has invited you to ride a goat to the Redhorn Lodes if the journey is too difficult on foot.\n",
[13718]="7005D3A2\n1\tTalk to Ausma in Bárgstad\tAusma has requested your aid in her mission in the Pit of Stonejaws. You will find Scout-master Ausma at the dwarf-camp Bárgstad.\n",
[13719]="700267CE\n1\tFind Andras in the Starkmoor\tThe Starkmoor is to the south-west of Pren Gwydh. You should search for Andras, the leader of a caravan, on the road from Pren Gwydh to the Starkmoor.\n",
[13720]="7003AB82\n1\tFind Oter in the Stonedeans\tOter can be found on the road in the Stonedeans, near Woodhurst. You should hasten to the Stonedeans and find out more from Oter.\n",
[13721]="70021666\n1\tTalk to Dodder Twofoot (take a horse from the Michel Delving stable to get to the Party Tree, and then take the horse to Taste of Hobbiton)\tThe Taste of Hobbiton can be accessed by taking the horse at the Michel Delving stable-master to the Party Tree, and from there taking the horse to the Taste of Hobbiton. The horses are only available during the event. You should head to the Michel Delving's stable, where a horse will take you to the Party Tree.\n",
[13722]="7005D3A1\n1\tTalk to Hórin in Fellgát, a camp in the northern reaches of the Welkin-lofts\tAusma has sent word that the hobgoblins are moving into the Welkin-lofts. Your orders are to assist Hórin with tracking them down. You will find Hórin at a camp in the northern reaches of the Welkin-lofts called Fellgát.\n",
[13723]="7003A69F\n1\tFind Gandalf in the Westfold\tYou believe that Gandalf can be found in the centre of the Westfold, perhaps on the road. You should seek Gandalf.\n",
[13724]="7003AB67\n1\tSpeak with Gandalf in the Westfold\tGandalf can be found upon the road in the centre of the Westfold. You should make haste and ride to Gandalf.\n",
[13725]="700529C7\n1\tTravel to Vegbár\tVegbár, the Beorning outpost in the Wolf-denes, can be found south-west of the Beorninghús. You should travel to Vegbár to find Langhár.\n2\tTalk to Langhár\tLanghár can be found somewhere in Vegbár. You should talk to Langhár.\n",
[13726]="700164DB\n1\tCollect toad-slime (total: 8)\tToads can be found all over the Water-works and to the east of the Great Wheel. Gyrgir believes with some toad-slime he can create a solution to the lizard problem.\n2\tTalk to Gyrgir in Hulwul-nefekh\030Collect Toad-slime (total: 8)\tGyrgir is in Hulwul-nefekh in central Water-works. You should bring the toad-slime you collected to Gyrgir.\n",
[13727]="7000B95B\n1\tCollect slimy toad legs (total: 6)\030Collect rough toad tongues (total: 6)\tToads can be found along the river-banks in Tâl Bruinen. Indor has asked you to help him collect the various ingredients he needs to make toad stew, a recipe given to him by the Dwarf Wéthorm. He reminded you that only the green river-toads will provide tongues and legs of sufficient quality.\n2\tBring the toad stew ingredients to Indor\tIndor is at Echad Candelleth, the Elf-camp in Tâl Bruinen. You have collected many bits of toad with which Indor plans to make toad stew. You should bring them to him.\n3\tGrind toad stew ingredients into mush on the grinding stone\tThere is a grinding stone right next to the camp-fire by Indor, at Echad Candelleth. Indor is waiting for you to grind the ingredients for toad stew into a mush.\n4\tBring the toad mush to Indor\tIndor is at the camp-fire at Echad Candelleth, in Tâl Bruinen. You have ground the toad pieces into mush and should now give them to Indor so he can add the finishing touches to the toad stew.\n",
[13728]="7006C701\n1\tComplete the instance: Together Now\tAshâmi and Raphûz are prepared to make their assault against the Ordâkhai camp to distract them from the main force attack Kûr Anzar. They asked you to accompany and help them.\n2\tSpeak with Ashâmi at her home in Urmâkh\030Speak with Raphûz at his home in Urmâkh\tYou successfully engaged the enemy at Dûl Zidur and were issued a dire warning by the cultists there. Ashâmi and Raphûz visited Numûru upon their return and want to tell you what transpired.\n3\tSpeak with Numûru at his post at Urmâkh\tAshâmi and Raphûz asked you to make your way to Numûru and explain you also heard the warning from the cultist. You can find him at his post in Urmâkh.\n4\tNumûru was quick to dismiss the possible threat for the existential threat he can see. You should return to Ashâmi and Raphûz at their home in Urmâkh to inform them of your meeting.\t\n",
})
